  "title": "所持品",
  "nav_label": "所持品",
  "description": "ストーントップの所持品別紙。軽荷・通常の荷・重荷ごとの◇の枠数、装備と小さな品物の一覧、物資の使用、繁栄による装備の質。",
  "sections": {
    "undefined": "未定",
    "gear": "装備",
    "possessions-items-loot": "所持品・道具・戦利品",
    "other-things": "その他",
    "small-items": "小さな品物",
    "prosperity": "繁栄"
  },
  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>あなたが <strong><em>装備を整える</em></strong>とき、下の◇をいくつかマークする。具体的な品物か「未定」に。</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>荷が <strong>軽荷</strong> (<em>素早く静か</em>）なら、◇を3つまでマーク</li>\n<li>荷が <strong>通常の荷</strong>なら、◇を4〜6つマーク</li>\n<li>荷が <strong>重荷</strong> (<em>うるさい、遅い、暑い、すぐ疲れる</em>）なら、◇を7〜9つマーク</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">未定</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"マーク1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"マーク1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"マーク2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"マーク2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"マーク3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"マーク3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"マーク4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"マーク4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"マーク5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"マーク5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"マーク6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"マーク6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"マーク7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"マーク7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"マーク8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"マーク8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"マーク9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"マーク9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>あなたが <strong><em>備えあり</em></strong>を使うとき、ここのマークを1つ、下の特定の◇へ移す。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">装備</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>物資</strong> （4+繁栄の使用 ○○○○ ○○）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>追加の物資</strong> （4+繁栄の使用 ○○○○ ○○）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>さらに追加の物資</strong> （4+繁栄の使用 ○○○○ ○○）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>物資は療養する、野営する、あるいは追加の <em>小さな</em> 品物を持つために使う。</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>炊事道具</strong> （火と水が必要。物資が長持ちする）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>寝具</strong> （野営するとき、追加で1d6のHPを回復）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>毛布</strong> (<em>暖かい</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>着替え</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>縄</strong>、約7.5m</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>シャベル</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>そり／担架／引き橇</strong>、丸めて運べる</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>かんじき</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>松明</strong> （約1時間もつ。 <em>間合い</em>, <em>範囲</em>, <em>危険</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>油ランプ</strong> （○○○時間、 <em>近接</em>, <em>範囲</em>, <em>粗悪</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>予備の油</strong> （○○○○○時間。ランプや角灯用。武器としては役に立たない）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>薪</strong> （一晩分。 <em>間合い</em>, <em>範囲</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>手斧</strong>、鉄製（<em>至近</em>, <em>投擲</em>、x貫通）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>槌</strong>、鉄製または木製（<em>至近</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>つるはし</strong>、鉄製（<em>近接</em>、x貫通、 <em>凄惨</em>, <em>扱いづらい</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>大槌</strong>、鉄製（<em>近接</em>, <em>剛力</em>, <em>扱いづらい</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>杖</strong> (<em>近接</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>槍</strong>、鉄製（<em>近接</em>, <em>投擲</em>、x貫通）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>長槍</strong>、鉄製（<em>間合い</em>、x貫通）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>弓と鉄の矢</strong> (<em>近距離</em>、x貫通、○残り矢わずか、○矢切れ）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>予備の矢</strong> （x貫通、○まだ十分、○残り矢わずか、○矢切れ）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>投げ槍</strong>、数本、鉄製（<em>投擲</em>、x貫通、+1ダメージ、○投げ尽くした）</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>盾</strong> （+1鎧、守り抜くで7+なら構え+1）</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>厚い毛皮</strong> （鎧1、 <em>暖かい</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>外套</strong> (<em>暖かい</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">所持品・道具・戦利品</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"枠\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"品物\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">その他</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">（動物、道具一式、預けた品など）</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"その他\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">小さな品物</h3>\n<p>懐や小袋、長靴に収まる。あなたが <strong><em>装備を整える</em></strong>とき、下の☐を4+繁栄の数だけマークする。</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">未定</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"マーク1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"マーク1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"マーク2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"マーク2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"マーク3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"マーク3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"マーク4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"マーク4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"マーク5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"マーク5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"マーク6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"マーク6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>あなたが <strong><em>備えあり</em></strong>を使うとき、ここのマークを1つ下の品物へ移す。または物資を消費して☐をもう1つマークする。</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>ナイフまたは短剣</strong>、鉄製（<em>至近</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>投石紐</strong> (<em>近距離</em>, <em>装填</em>, <em>扱いづらい</em>、○弾切れ間近、○弾切れ）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>灯心草のあかり</strong> （約15〜30分もつ。 <em>至近</em>, <em>粗悪</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-tinderbox\" data-check-id=\"inv-tinderbox\"> <span><strong>火口箱</strong> (<em>遅い</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-needle-thread\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-needle-thread\" data-check-id=\"inv-needle-thread\"> <span><strong>針と糸</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-coppers\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-coppers\" data-check-id=\"inv-coppers\"> <span><strong>銅貨ひとつかみ</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-whisky\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-whisky\" data-check-id=\"inv-whisky\"> <span><strong>ウィスキー</strong>、革袋（○○使用）</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-awl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-awl\" data-check-id=\"inv-awl\"> <span>錐</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-bowstring\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bowstring\" data-check-id=\"inv-bowstring\"> <span>弓弦</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-chalk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-chalk\" data-check-id=\"inv-chalk\"> <span>白墨</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-charcoal\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-charcoal\" data-check-id=\"inv-charcoal\"> <span>木炭</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-clay-jar\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki